          900.0,
          496.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "Molded samples from the prepared materials were produced using an Arburg 55 ton injection molding machine with a rectangular center-gated mold. The shot size was controlled to 85% mold fill to allow for foam growth. The temperature profile of the plasticating unit and nozzle were set at 30, 210, 210, 250, 290, and 300-C, respectively, from the hopper to the nozzle so to prevent premature decomposition of CBA."
